.claude/*
# ...except the decision record, which is tracked in THIS repo and deliberately
# never shipped: the plugin's ship list is derived from `git ls-tree publish/main`,
# so a file that has never been published stays unpublished unless named with --add.
# Note `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: git will not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so a negation inside one never matches. Everything else in .claude/
# (checkpoint, settings, scratch plans) stays ignored.
!.claude/decisions.md
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
